          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><div><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">VittaBurn </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">is marketed as a dietary supplement for weight-management and metabolic wellness. Its potential benefits depend on the product's actual ingredients, their dosages, and the available scientific evidence. Since its official ingredient list has not yet been verified, the following benefits are general possibilities associated with certain weight-management supplements rather than confirmed effects of VittaBurn.</span><br></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><div><b>✅Supports Weight-Management Goals –</b>&nbsp;VittaBurn may appeal to adults looking for additional support with their weight-management routine. However, sustainable weight management depends primarily on dietary habits, physical activity, sleep, and other individual factors. The supplement's effectiveness has not been established by product-specific clinical evidence.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅Supports Normal Metabolic Function– </b>Metabolism describes the processes through which the body converts food into energy and maintains normal physiological functions. Depending on its verified formulation, VittaBurn may contain ingredients associated with normal metabolic processes. This does not mean the supplement necessarily increases metabolism or produces significant weight loss.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅Supports Normal Nervous-System Function –</b>&nbsp;The nervous system helps the brain process information received through the senses, including sound. SonoVive's reported ingredients are associated with research into neurological processes, but there is no established evidence that the supplement improves auditory nerve function.</div></div><div><div><b><br></b></div></div><div><div><b>✅May Support Energy Levels– </b>Some weight-management supplements contain caffeine or other stimulant ingredients that can temporarily increase alertness. Whether VittaBurn provides this effect depends on its actual ingredients and amounts. Products containing stimulants may also cause nervousness, sleep disturbances, or a rapid heartbeat in some people.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅May Complement Physical Activity –</b>&nbsp;A structured exercise routine can support fitness, cardiovascular health, and weight management. If VittaBurn contains ingredients appropriate for the individual, it may be used alongside a broader wellness routine. It should not be considered a replacement for exercise, adequate nutrition, or recovery.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Supports Nutritional Wellness –</b>&nbsp;Some dietary supplements provide vitamins, minerals, or other nutrients involved in normal bodily functions. The nutritional contribution of VittaBurn, if any, can only be determined by reviewing its official Supplement Facts label. Supplements should not replace a varied, balanced diet.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅May Complement Healthy Eating Habits –&nbsp; &nbsp;</b>Long-term weight management often involves balanced meals, appropriate portion sizes, and consistent eating habits. A supplement may form part of a personal wellness plan, but there is insufficient evidence to claim that VittaBurn independently controls appetite or reduces food cravings.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Encourages a Consistent Wellness Routine –</b>&nbsp;Following a regular schedule for meals, physical activity, hydration, and sleep can help people build sustainable health habits. VittaBurn may be incorporated into a routine if its ingredients are suitable and the label directions are followed, but consistency with healthy habits matters more than relying on a supplement alone.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Offers a Convenient Supplement Format –</b>&nbsp;For people who prefer a packaged dietary supplement, VittaBurn may offer a convenient format for following the manufacturer's recommended serving instructions. Before use, check the label for ingredient quantities, allergens, warnings, and potential interactions with medications.</span></div></div><br><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅May Support General Fitness Goals –</b>&nbsp;Weight-management goals often overlap with broader fitness objectives, such as improving stamina, maintaining muscle, and developing regular exercise habits. VittaBurn's contribution to these goals cannot be confirmed without knowing its ingredients and reviewing reliable evidence for the finished product.</span></div></div><br><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Fits Into a Long-Term Wellness Plan – </b>A balanced approach to weight management focuses on sustainable habits rather than rapid results. Nutritious food choices, regular movement, adequate sleep, and appropriate professional guidance can all contribute to long-term well-being. No supplement should be assumed to deliver guaranteed weight loss.</span></div></div><div><div><br></div></div></h2>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
